  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Oath.LevelConfig
  levelIndex: 0
  title: "V\xF2ng V\xE2y B\u1EA5t T\u1EADn"
  location: "Kinh \u0111\xF4 Elaria"
  description: "C\xE1c \u0111\u1EE3t \u0111\u1ECBch n\u1ED1i ti\u1EBFp kh\xF4ng ng\u1EEBng. Tr\u1EE5 c\xE0ng l\xE2u c\xE0ng t\u1ED1t!"
  objective: "Sinh t\u1ED3n"
  sceneName: 20_Endless
  intro:
  - speaker: Mira
    text: "Trinh s\xE1t b\xE1o: l\u0169 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt k\xE9o t\u1EDBi t\u1EEB kh\u1EAFp c\xE1c h\xF2n \u0111\u1EA3o, kh\xF4ng bi\u1EBFt bao gi\u1EDD m\u1EDBi d\u1EE9t."
  - speaker: Kael
    text: "V\u1EADy th\xEC ch\xFAng ta s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EE9ng v\u1EEFng t\u1EDBi c\xF9ng. X\xE2y th\xE1p, gi\u1EEF kinh \u0111\xF4 \u2014 tr\u1EE5 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c bao l\xE2u hay b\u1EA5y l\xE2u!"
  outro: []
  tutorialHints:
  - "Ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 Sinh t\u1ED3n: m\u1ED7i \u0111\u1EE3t m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n \u0111\u1EE3t tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, c\u1EE9 <b>5 \u0111\u1EE3t</b> l\u1EA1i c\xF3 m\u1ED9t th\u1EE7 l\u0129nh."
  - "K\u1EBFt h\u1EE3p nhi\u1EC1u lo\u1EA1i th\xE1p: B\u1EAFn \u0110\xE1 cho \u0111\xE1m \u0111\xF4ng, Bi S\u1EAFt cho qu\xE1i gi\xE1p d\xE0y, B\xFAa \u0110\u1ECBa Ch\u1EA5n gi\u1EEF ch\xE2n \u0111\u1ECBch."
